# Keep the Docker build context small: the first build shipped a 1.63 GB
# context (venv, local Chroma data, uploads, .git) and took ~3 hours.
# The image builds its own dependencies from requirements.txt, and the
# app's data lives in named volumes (mounted by docker-compose.yml), so
# none of these belong in the image. With this file the context is a few
# MB and a cached rebuild takes minutes.
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
venv
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
chromadb_data
uploads
logs
.env
.pytest_cache
tests
*.log
.vscode
.idea
